    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u09.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Comparatives",
        "ru": "Сравнительная степень"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Compare two things. Short adjectives add -er + than; long adjectives use \"more … than\". Some are irregular: good → better, bad → worse.",
        "ru": "Сравнивай два предмета. Короткие прилагательные + -er + than; длинные — \"more … than\". Есть исключения: good → better, bad → worse."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "short + -er",
            "ru": "короткие + -er"
          },
          "formula": "adjective + -er than",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "This shirt is cheaper than that one.",
              "ru": "Эта рубашка дешевле той."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "comparatives"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "more + long",
            "ru": "more + длинные"
          },
          "formula": "more + adjective + than",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "This coat is more expensive than the jacket.",
              "ru": "Это пальто дороже куртки."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "comparatives"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "irregular",
            "ru": "исключения"
          },
          "formula": "good → better · bad → worse",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "These shoes are better than the old ones.",
              "ru": "Эта обувь лучше старой."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "comparatives"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Double the last letter for short vowel + consonant: big → bigger, hot → hotter.",
          "ru": "Удвой последнюю букву после краткого гласного: big → bigger, hot → hotter."
        },
        {
          "en": "Don't mix forms: \"more cheaper\" is wrong — say \"cheaper\".",
          "ru": "Не смешивай формы: \"more cheaper\" — ошибка, говори \"cheaper\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u09.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "Two jackets",
        "ru": "Две куртки"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u09.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "In the shop there were two jackets. The blue one was cheaper, but the black one was warmer and more comfortable. It was also more expensive.",
          "ru": "В магазине было две куртки. Синяя была дешевле, но чёрная — теплее и удобнее. Она была ещё и дороже.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u09.d01.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u09.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "I tried both. The black jacket was bigger and better for winter. \"This one is nicer,\" said my friend. So I bought the black one.",
          "ru": "Я примерил обе. Чёрная куртка была больше и лучше для зимы. «Эта симпатичнее», — сказал друг. Так что я купил чёрную.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u09.d01.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
